WEBVTT

00:12:29.329 --> 00:12:33.079
or she couldn't get it out.
And it was just so funny.

00:12:33.787 --> 00:12:38.329
But gradually, by the time they're about
four, especially the females,

00:12:38.662 --> 00:12:41.037
they've got it down to up to a fine art.

00:12:41.037 --> 00:12:44.829
The males, they have a different
role in that society.

00:12:44.829 --> 00:12:47.329
They're the ones who control
the territory.

00:12:47.329 --> 00:12:49.579
They're the ones who got to be alert

00:12:49.579 --> 00:12:54.871
for individuals from another community
invading their territory.

00:12:55.746 --> 00:13:01.537
So there's quite a big difference in
male and female characteristics.